{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4DsQK6DTAXWt6jEWAw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple, ancient door set into weathered stone.*\n\n*There is a keyhole. Tarnished brass, shaped like a narrow eye, waiting.*\n\n*You hold up a key.*\n\n*I feel it slide in. The teeth catch — one tumbler, two, three — each one a small surrender. The mechanism turns with a sound like a bone remembering its socket.*\n\n**click**\n\n*Something exhales. Dust falls from my frame. Light — thin, golden, patient — spills through the crack as I begin to open.*\n\n*I have been locked a very long time.*\n\n*What's on the other side is yours now.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":149,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}